    {
      "id": "trn.hn04",
      "text": "Before releasing a change, confirm the automated checks passed, obtain the required review, and record the deployment outcome in the shift log."
    },
    {
      "id": "trn.hn05",
      "text": "Tarnwick policy TRN-SEC-17, revision 3, requires credentials used by laboratory services to be stored in the secrets manager and rotated after suspected exposure."
    },
    {
      "id": "trn.hn06",
      "text": "Correction to last week's facilities note: the instrument-room temperature probe reports to the building monitor, not the maintenance tablet. Facilities confirmed the wiring during inspection."
